## 1. Definitions

* **"Licensed Materials"** means the AutoYou source code, compiled binaries,
  executables, scripts, assets, web pages, documentation, configuration files,
  tests, build instructions, and other materials that OpenStorey distributes
  under this License, excluding Third-Party Materials.
* **"Third-Party Materials"** means software, models, SDKs, libraries, APIs,
  services, media, fonts, data, or other material owned by a third party and
  governed by its own license or terms.
* **"Personal Use"** means use by a natural person for that person's private,
  non-commercial purposes on devices that person owns or is authorized to
  control, including personal use, household use, personal education,
  research, evaluation, accessibility, and private development. Personal Use
  does not include use for an employer, company, customer, public body,
  organization, paid service, production operation, or business process.
* **"Enterprise Use"** means any use by, for, or on behalf of a company,
  employer, partnership, public body, nonprofit, school as an organization,
  customer, or other organization, or any use in a paid, customer-facing,
  production, managed, hosted, or revenue-generating operation.
* **"Derivative Work"** means a modification, adaptation, integration,
  compilation, build, installer, package, hosted service, fork, plugin, agent
  bundle, white-label version, or other work based on or incorporating the
  Licensed Materials.
* **"Official Build"** means an artifact that OpenStorey or an authorized
  release operator builds, signs, notarizes, publishes, or presents as an
  authorized AutoYou release. A private build is not an Official Build merely
  because it uses the AutoYou name in a source comment or because it was
  compiled from public source.

The term **"AutoYou Owner Board"** refers to a governance designation used by
OpenStorey. It is not a separate contracting party, guarantor, charity, or
trust unless a separate instrument expressly identifies and authorizes it as
such. OpenStorey is the licensor and contracting party for this License.

